# phase3_ai_demo.re - Phase 3 Pack E local AI helpers demo.
# Module: demo (antinomia script).
# Owns: explain / suggest_bp / summarize_ex sequencing for CI.
# Depends: antinomia CLI. @INFERIOR@ substituted at configure time.

init @INFERIOR@
wait_event 5000
wait_event 5000
explain
summarize_ex 11
suggest_bp --limit 8
kill
